OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cooler, fresher start
OL,6,Fthan of late, Friday will be a mostly
OL,7,Fdry day with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,8,FWinds will be generally light and
OL,9,Fit'll feel pleasantly warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine. The odd shower possible in
OL,11,Fthe northwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry night will follow with
OL,14,Fclear spells and generally light winds
OL,15,Ffor all. Feeling rather cool and fresh
OL,16,Fonce again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
